# ===== The Veil, task 3: the Doubles' spells =====
# Ids and kit by level: goals/ARCANA_Deceiver_Doubles.txt (AddSpell, Task 2). Spec 3.1 / 4.3.
# No LevelMap, no SpellSlotsGroup, no ARCANA_IS_CARD mark. Every spell is IsSpell and can be cast only by a Double
# (RequirementConditions on the DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL shimmer status, applied by the Doubles goal): Mirrored Spell copies
# any IsSpell spell cast near its holder into her spellbook, and Shatter, left to a copy, would hurt whoever cast it (the goal retires only registered Doubles).
# Needs 10_doubt.patch (DOUBT_ADD_TECH) and 20_doubles.patch (DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL) for the game to run; the dry run
# of this file alone is clean (statuses are only named in strings).

# ---------- Text ----------
@loca DBL_SHATTER_NAME Shatter
@loca DBL_SHATTER_DESC Burst in a flash of illusory glass, dealing [1] to enemies within [2] and sowing <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="DOUBT_1">Doubt</LSTag> in their minds. The Double is destroyed.
@loca DBL_UNVEIL_NAME Unveil
@loca DBL_UNVEIL_DESC Swap places with the Deceiver.
@loca DBL_UNVEIL_EXTRA Only one of the Deceiver's Doubles can do this each round.
@loca DBL_UNVEIL_USED_NAME Unveiled
# Existing handles, kept: the names of the two Mirror spells (they now belong to the Doubles' spells), and their
# descriptions, rewritten for the fixed numbers.
@loca hf22a0eedgbc8dgc316g2434g51c6f4982dc4 Hurl a sliver of <LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Projectile_Arcana_Card_Spell_SigilofMalice">Sigil of Malice</LSTag> at a creature, dealing [1] and marking it with the Deceiver's <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="SIGIL">Sigil</LSTag>.
@loca h19148393g43edg142eg8af8gc41f2c6b60f9 Bind a creature with a weakened <LSTag Type="Spell" Tooltip="Target_Arcana_Card_Spell_EtherealChains">Ethereal Chains</LSTag>. If it fails the <LSTag Tooltip="SavingThrow">Saving Throw</LSTag>, it takes [1] and becomes <LSTag Type="Status" Tooltip="RESTRAINED">Restrained</LSTag> for [2].

# ---------- Removals: the clone's old Mirror spells and what only they used ----------
# References checked in 30_double_spells.md. The marker item template 4441890b-... (Mirror Distortion) and the
# goal ARCANA_Spell_MirrorWithdraw.txt are outside stats (Task 4 deletes the goal).
@remove Target_Deceiver_Clone_MirrorDistortion
@remove Projectile_Deceiver_Clone_MirrorSigilofMalice
@remove Target_Deceiver_Clone_MirrorEtherealChains
@remove Shout_Deceiver_Clone_MirrorWithdraw
@remove Projectile_Arcana_MirrorDistortion_Explosion
@remove MIRROR_ETHEREAL_CHAINS
@remove MIRROR_DISTORTION_HELPER

# SIGIL and ETHEREAL_CHAINS_EFFECT both named MIRROR_ETHEREAL_CHAINS in a list. SIGIL: the new Mirror: Ethereal
# Chains needs no status in the list (its damage is dealt by the spell, which carries ARCANA_IS_SPELL, so
# IsArcanaSpell() detonates the mark). Nothing else in the lists changes.
@set SIGIL RemoveConditions (IsArcanaSpell() or HasAnyStatus({'ETHEREAL_CHAINS','ETHEREAL_CHAINS_3','ETHEREAL_CHAINS_4','ETHEREAL_CHAINS_5','ETHEREAL_CHAINS_6','MIMIC_ETHEREAL_CHAINS','MIMIC_ETHEREAL_CHAINS_2','MIMIC_ETHEREAL_CHAINS_3','MIMIC_ETHEREAL_CHAINS_4','MIMIC_ETHEREAL_CHAINS_5','MIMIC_ETHEREAL_CHAINS_6'})) and (HasStatus('SIGIL', context.Target, context.Source) or HasStatus('SIGIL', context.Target, GetSummoner(context.Source)))
@set ETHEREAL_CHAINS_EFFECT RemoveConditions not HasAnyStatus({'ETHEREAL_CHAINS','ETHEREAL_CHAINS_3','ETHEREAL_CHAINS_4','ETHEREAL_CHAINS_5','ETHEREAL_CHAINS_6','MIMIC_ETHEREAL_CHAINS','MIMIC_ETHEREAL_CHAINS_2','MIMIC_ETHEREAL_CHAINS_3','MIMIC_ETHEREAL_CHAINS_4','MIMIC_ETHEREAL_CHAINS_5','MIMIC_ETHEREAL_CHAINS_6'})

# ---------- The round marker for Unveil ----------
@file Status_BOOST
@section DECEIVER STATUS

# On HER, applied by Unveil (any of her Doubles). Duration 1 with TickType EndRound = until the end of this round
# (vanilla SURPRISED is applied for 1 and ends the same way). Not a combat status: it goes at once outside combat
# (RemoveConditions with OnApply, vanilla HOSTILE shape) and when combat ends (RAGE shape), so Unveil is only
# limited inside a fight. Hidden.
new entry "UNVEIL_USED_TECH"
type "StatusData"
data "StatusType" "BOOST"
data "DisplayName" "{{DBL_UNVEIL_USED_NAME}}"
data "StackId" "UNVEIL_USED_TECH"
data "StackType" "Overwrite"
data "TickType" "EndRound"
data "RemoveConditions" "not Combat()"
data "RemoveEvents" "OnApply;OnCombatEnded"
data "StatusPropertyFlags" "DisableOverhead;DisableCombatlog;DisablePortraitIndicator"

# ---------- Shatter ----------
@file Spell_Shout
@section Shout_DECEIVER SPELLS

# The burst only: the area part follows Shout_LOW_HoH_DebtorExplosion (plain functors in SpellProperties hit every target
# of AreaRadius that passes TargetConditions). The spell does NOT kill its caster: a CAST: functor is its own context, so
# list order cannot order it against the area hits (vanilla Shout_GOB_DetonateSelf uses CAST:Kill() only with item-only
# hits), and a Kill that resolved first would leave Shatter doing nothing. The Doubles goal retires the Double 800 ms
# after CastSpell through its no-blame retire path (goals/ARCANA_Deceiver_Doubles.txt, region "Task 3, fix round 1").
# Each enemy hit gets DOUBT_ADD_TECH with the Double as its cause (the Doubt goal credits the Deceiver through
# DB_ARCANA_MirrorImageOf, which the goal keeps ~1 s after the retire). No ARCANA_IS_SPELL mark: Shatter does not detonate
# Sigils (spec 4.3, the Sigil detonation is its own Doubt source).
new entry "Shout_Deceiver_Double_Shatter"
type "SpellData"
data "SpellType" "Shout"
data "SpellProperties" "DealDamage(1d6,Psychic,Magical);ApplyStatus(DOUBT_ADD_TECH,100,0)"
data "AreaRadius" "3"
data "TargetConditions" "Enemy() and Character() and not Dead()"
data "RequirementConditions" "HasStatus('DOUBLE_OF_THE_VEIL',context.Source)"
data "Icon" "Spell_Evocation_Shatter"
data "DisplayName" "{{DBL_SHATTER_NAME}}"
